SIGNIFICANT MODIFICATIONS BY LKLIGHT CONTRIBUTORS
================================================================================

The following modifications were made to the upstream lightdock-rust codebase
to produce LKlight:

Bug Fixes:
  - Embedded DFIRE, DFIRE2, and dDNA parameter matrices at compile time
    (src/dfire.rs, src/dfire2.rs, src/ddna.rs) — eliminating runtime panics
    caused by missing external parameter files.
  - Corrected ANM mode-vector stride computation in src/pisa.rs, src/ddna.rs,
    src/cpydock.rs, and src/sd.rs — the upstream code used a fixed stride
    inconsistent with the actual nmodes storage layout, causing out-of-bounds
    reads with ANM-enabled runs.
  - Added graceful handling for non-standard residues in src/dfire.rs —
    upstream code panicked on any residue outside the standard 20 amino acids.
  - Removed erroneous atom_count() assertion in src/simulator.rs that
    incorrectly assumed ANM covered all heavy atoms rather than Cα atoms only.

Performance Optimizations:
  - rayon-based parallelization of the receptor-atom outer loop in pydock.rs,
    dna.rs, cpydock.rs, dfire.rs, dfire2.rs, and sd.rs (H1/I1/I2/I3).
  - Refactored scoring hot paths into SIMD-friendly contiguous loops and
    reduced allocation pressure; local benchmark builds may additionally enable
    target-cpu=native, while published binaries use portable CPU baselines.
  - Precomputed sqrt_vdw_charges arrays eliminating hot-path sqrt() calls (F1).
  - Implemented 3D spatial hash grid in sd.rs (cell = 9 Å, 27-cell query) for
    genuine O(N²)→O(N) sparsification at short cutoff distances (F2).
  - Replaced per-line write() syscalls with BufWriter batching in swarm.rs (F3).
  - Changed qt::rotate() return type from Vec<f64> to [f64;3] (stack) (F4).
  - Replaced heap-allocated Glowworm::translation with [f64;3] (F5).
  - Added pos_scratch/rot_scratch scratch buffers to Swarm for reuse (G1).
  - Parallelized GSO movement_phase() with rayon::par_iter_mut() (G2).
  - thread_local! scratch-buffer reuse in all scoring functions.

Branding / Interface:
  - Project renamed from lightdock-rust to LKlight; binary renamed to LKlight.
  - Consolidated CLI entry point (src/bin/lightdock.rs) with unified subcommand
    interface (setup, run, generate, cluster, rank, top, filter, score,
    trajectory, pipeline).

